# Assets

## SVG (Shared)

- Location: `packages/core/assets/svgs/`
- Constants: `AppSvgs` in `packages/core/lib/src/assets/app_svgs.dart`
- Loading: `AppSvgPicture.asset(AppSvgs.iconName)` from `shared_widgets`
- Never `SvgPicture.asset()` directly — breaks package asset loading

## Adding a New SVG

1. Add file to `packages/core/assets/svgs/`
2. Add constant to `AppSvgs`
3. Use `AppSvgPicture.asset(AppSvgs.newIcon)`

## Fonts

- Declared in `packages/design_system/pubspec.yaml`
- Always via `AppFont` / `AppFontArabic` — never raw family name strings

## Images

- App-specific: `apps/<app>/assets/images/`
- Shared: `packages/core/assets/images/`
- Loading: `Image.asset(path, package: AppAssets.package)`

## Lottie

Store in `assets/animations/` — never in `assets/images/`

## Naming

`snake_case` for all asset files — no spaces or special characters

## Rules

- Declare every asset folder in owning package's `pubspec.yaml` under `flutter.assets`
- PNG assets ≤ 200 KB; provide `@2x` / `@3x` for non-SVG
- Never bundle assets in feature packages — use `core` (shared) or app (app-specific)
